Router Pattern : there is dispatcher agent which decides where to go
Input -> entry agent(agent) -> query -> dispatcher(where to go) -> the particular type agent(based on the query) -> end -> reply agent(gpt) -> output

Sequential Pattern : Sequential + Branching pattern -> Sequential : it follows a strict linear order, Branching : depends on condition(query asked)
ex : input -> search(gpt) -> curator -> winter(query asked) -> critique -> designer -> editor(gpt) -> output (publisher)

Hierarchical : when a task we break down in to multiple tasks then we have a supervisor that coordinates these tasks -> passed on to the multiple agents
user input -> supervisor(assigns to multiple tasks) -> Agent1 ( or agent 2) ...... -> supervisor -> output (user)

